# Never commit user-supplied or extracted Minecraft game files here.
*.apk
*.apks
*.xapk
*.zip
**/libminecraftpe.so
**/com.mojang/
**/versions/
**/profiles/
**/level.dat
**/level.dat_old
**/*.mcworld

# Local testing noise.
*.log
*.csv
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Local research and build scratch. Never publish these:
#   build/analysis-*.txt        objdump disassembly of libminecraftpe.so
#   build/device-captures/      UI textures captured from the running game
#   build/screenshots/          the same
# Those are derived Minecraft material and must not be redistributed. The rest
# is multi-hundred-MB build output and release staging that no clone needs.
/build/
/dist/
/recovery/
